{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1813899309420607216,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "RFC Merge Procedure",
      "source_hash": 3102526362047875447,
      "context_hash": 8603561098846259022,
      "translation": "RFC 병합 절차",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246228Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Once an RFC has been accepted (i.e., the final comment period is complete, and no major issues were raised), it must be merged.",
      "source_hash": 14020278571896240761,
      "context_hash": 15393403715481623638,
      "translation": "RFC가 승인되면(즉, 최종 의견 수렴 기간이 완료되고 주요 이슈가 제기되지 않았다면), 반드시 병합되어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC",
        "Final Comment Period": "최종 의견 수렴 기간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:44.172257Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Right now this is a manual process, though just about anyone can do it (if you're not a subteam member, though, you'll have to open a PR rather than merge the RFC manually).",
      "source_hash": 17433365865257995664,
      "context_hash": 14075178050570745069,
      "translation": "현재 이는 수동 프로세스이지만 거의 누구나 수행할 수 있습니다(다만 하위 팀 구성원이 아니라면 RFC를 직접 병합하는 대신 PR을 열어야 합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC",
        "subteam": "하위 팀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:44.172258Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Here is the complete set of steps to merge an RFC -- in some cases, not all the steps will be applicable.",
      "source_hash": 2272429020633414745,
      "context_hash": 4415074631909511484,
      "translation": "다음은 RFC를 병합하는 전체 단계입니다 -- 경우에 따라 모든 단계가 적용되지는 않을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246229Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: Open tracking issue",
      "source_hash": 4591198880452026217,
      "context_hash": 15348283173510919057,
      "translation": "1단계: 추적 이슈 열기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "tracking issue": "추적 이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Open a tracking issue over on rust-lang/rust.",
      "source_hash": 13411873713832520561,
      "context_hash": 12839977830617018921,
      "translation": "rust-lang/rust에 추적 이슈를 여십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "tracking issue": "추적 이슈",
        "issue": "이슈",
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:44.172259Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Here is a template for the issue text.",
      "source_hash": 5162332042384666527,
      "context_hash": 262036403216014900,
      "translation": "다음은 이슈 텍스트용 템플릿입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "You'll have to adjust the various places labeled XXX with some suitable content (e.g., the name of the RFC, or the most appropriate team).",
      "source_hash": 15615482866169360230,
      "context_hash": 4665422036775067275,
      "translation": "XXX로 표시된 여러 부분을 적절한 내용으로 조정해야 합니다(예: RFC 이름 또는 가장 적합한 팀).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Add the following labels to the issue:",
      "source_hash": 16436253376493711222,
      "context_hash": 3812059863274486383,
      "translation": "이슈에 다음 라벨을 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`B-rfc-approved`",
      "source_hash": 16372481196470894005,
      "context_hash": 35415678484580592,
      "translation": "`B-rfc-approved`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`C-tracking-issue`",
      "source_hash": 8758095183796512810,
      "context_hash": 6409445544482778792,
      "translation": "`C-tracking-issue`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "the appropriate `T-XXX` label",
      "source_hash": 7975701363525155884,
      "context_hash": 1595787699198509890,
      "translation": "적절한 `T-XXX` 레이블",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:44.172259Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "(If you don't have permissions to do so, leave a note cc'ing the appropriate team and asking them to do so.)",
      "source_hash": 13848439535897539602,
      "context_hash": 1392619164758511390,
      "translation": "(권한이 없다면 적절한 팀을 참조(cc)로 지정하여 이를 해달라고 요청하는 메모를 남기십시오.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: Merge the RFC PR itself",
      "source_hash": 2449900311859031417,
      "context_hash": 12414879802059326908,
      "translation": "2단계: RFC PR 자체를 병합하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Once FCP has completed with no concerns unaddressed, in your local git checkout:",
      "source_hash": 10895283515599274280,
      "context_hash": 11350700635613684095,
      "translation": "해결되지 않은 우려 사항 없이 FCP가 완료되면, 로컬 git 체크아웃에서 다음을 수행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FCP": "FCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:44.172259Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Check out your RFC PR's branch",
      "source_hash": 5431941131074848921,
      "context_hash": 11250497925370827581,
      "translation": "RFC PR의 브랜치를 체크아웃하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Add a commit that moves the file name from 0000- to its RFC number",
      "source_hash": 6897163690395238141,
      "context_hash": 240564930490491158,
      "translation": "파일 이름을 0000-에서 해당 RFC 번호로 옮기는 커밋을 추가하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Edit the new file to include links to the RFC PR and the tracking issue you just created in the header",
      "source_hash": 14678894834610156175,
      "context_hash": 9441777775024168379,
      "translation": "새 파일을 편집하여 헤더에 RFC PR과 방금 생성한 추적 이슈로의 링크를 포함시키십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC",
        "issue": "이슈",
        "tracking issue": "추적 이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Push to your RFC PR",
      "source_hash": 6201991996742679562,
      "context_hash": 9801778714119779440,
      "translation": "RFC PR에 푸시하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "RFC": "RFC"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "If you have permissions to merge PRs to rust-lang/rfcs, click the merge button on your PR in the GitHub UI.",
      "source_hash": 406973894090369727,
      "context_hash": 10098896572383842374,
      "translation": "rust-lang/rfcs에 PR을 병합할 권한이 있다면, GitHub UI에서 자신의 PR에 있는 병합 버튼을 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:16:44.172259Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "If you don't have permission to merge the PR, comment with `r? internal-sites` to have a maintainer merge it on your behalf.",
      "source_hash": 17287323004479883790,
      "context_hash": 11360548864399575766,
      "translation": "PR을 병합할 권한이 없다면 `r? internal-sites`라고 댓글을 남겨 메인테이너가 대신 병합하도록 하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "maintainer": "메인테이너"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3: Leave a comment",
      "source_hash": 1881496793875932989,
      "context_hash": 3175391175267844878,
      "translation": "3단계: 댓글 남기기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Leave a final comment on the PR directing everyone to the tracking issue.",
      "source_hash": 4797347268588775313,
      "context_hash": 8529881469301629921,
      "translation": "모두를 추적 이슈로 안내하는 마지막 댓글을 PR에 남기십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "tracking issue": "추적 이슈",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:18/seg:1",
      "source": "Something like this, but feel free to add your own personal flavor (and change the team):",
      "source_hash": 13580741944229746106,
      "context_hash": 10161374630791500395,
      "translation": "다음과 비슷하게 작성하되, 자유롭게 개인적인 느낌을 더하십시오(그리고 팀을 변경하십시오):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "That's it, you're done!",
      "source_hash": 5936028806196606800,
      "context_hash": 15655216837315854048,
      "translation": "이것으로 끝입니다, 완료되었습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:40:49.246232Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}